---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Contribute" description="How to contribute to khensu.nu.">
  <p class="eyebrow">Contribute</p>
  <h1>Contribute</h1>
  <p class="lede">Contributions open with each repository.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Outside contributors sign a contributor licence agreement once, through a bot on your first pull request.</li>
    <li>Cryptography and protocol changes need a written design and review before code.</li>
    <li>Nothing may process user data on a server, and no feature may make privacy or stealth optional.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Want to help before then? Write to <a href="mailto:hello@elliottwave.studio?subject=khensu.nu%20contribute">hello@elliottwave.studio</a>.</p>
</Base>
